- Rising edge detection for pushEn and popEn
- FIFO logic with pop first, then push
- When both pop and push happen at same time on full queue: pop first (makes space), then push
- When both pop and push happen at same time on empty queue: pop does nothing (empty), then push adds item
- count, full, empty, head are outputs

